--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0f0270995b78b08499239e6f7c22adc3, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroLevel1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  lines:
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: -236619611796383025, guid: 929b384521a106348bd3402cf4a27fc6, type: 3}
    text: "Log Entry #001\u2026 The experiment failed."
    vnText: "Nh\u1EADt k\xFD th\xED nghi\u1EC7m #001\u2026 th\xED nghi\u1EC7m \u0111\xE3
      th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i."
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: -236619611796383025, guid: 929b384521a106348bd3402cf4a27fc6, type: 3}
    text: E-Core reacted far beyond our projections. The containment field collapsed
      in seconds.
    vnText: "E-Core ph\u1EA3n \u1EE9ng v\u01B0\u1EE3t xa m\u1ECDi d\u1EF1 \u0111o\xE1n.
      Tr\u01B0\u1EDDng giam gi\u1EEF s\u1EE5p \u0111\u1ED5 ch\u1EC9 trong v\xE0i
      gi\xE2y."
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: -236619611796383025, guid: 929b384521a106348bd3402cf4a27fc6, type: 3}
    text: "I remember the alarms. The surge. Then\u2026 nothing."
    vnText: "T\xF4i nh\u1EDB ti\u1EBFng c\xF2i b\xE1o \u0111\u1ED9ng. C\xFA b\xF9ng
      n\u1ED5. R\u1ED3i\u2026 kh\xF4ng c\xF2n g\xEC n\u1EEFa."
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: -236619611796383025, guid: 929b384521a106348bd3402cf4a27fc6, type: 3}
    text: "When I woke up, the lab was in ruins. Most of the staff\u2026 gone."
    vnText: "Khi t\u1EC9nh l\u1EA1i, ph\xF2ng th\xED nghi\u1EC7m ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n
      l\xE0 \u0111\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED5 n\xE1t. H\u1EA7u h\u1EBFt m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi\u2026
      \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t."
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: -236619611796383025, guid: 929b384521a106348bd3402cf4a27fc6, type: 3}
    text: "If the creatures escape this facility, the outside world won\u2019t survive."
    vnText: "N\u1EBFu b\u1ECDn sinh v\u1EADt n\xE0y tho\xE1t ra ngo\xE0i, th\u1EBF
      gi\u1EDBi b\xEAn ngo\xE0i s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t."
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: -236619611796383025, guid: 929b384521a106348bd3402cf4a27fc6, type: 3}
    text: "Emergency defense systems\u2026 online. I have to hold them here."
    vnText: "H\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7 kh\u1EA9n c\u1EA5p\u2026 k\xEDch
      ho\u1EA1t. T\xF4i ph\u1EA3i gi\u1EEF ch\xFAng l\u1EA1i \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y."
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: 5542236995676148328, guid: 3bd9ba424eb75a548b612d0f45f37964, type: 3}
    text: Warning. Experimental subject breach detected.
    vnText: "C\u1EA3nh b\xE1o. Ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng th\xED
      nghi\u1EC7m v\u01B0\u1EE3t ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t."
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: -236619611796383025, guid: 929b384521a106348bd3402cf4a27fc6, type: 3}
    text: "So it begins\u2026"
    vnText: "V\u1EADy l\xE0 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u r\u1ED3i\u2026"
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: -236619611796383025, guid: 929b384521a106348bd3402cf4a27fc6, type: 3}
    text: This sector still has power. I can activate automated turrets.
    vnText: "Khu v\u1EF1c n\xE0y v\u1EABn c\xF2n \u0111i\u1EC7n. T\xF4i c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t c\xE1c th\xE1p ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7 t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng."
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: -236619611796383025, guid: 929b384521a106348bd3402cf4a27fc6, type: 3}
    text: "I\u2019ll start small. Just enough to stop it."
    vnText: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1EEB quy m\xF4 nh\u1ECF th\xF4i. V\u1EEBa
      \u0111\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EB7n n\xF3 l\u1EA1i."
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: -236619611796383025, guid: 929b384521a106348bd3402cf4a27fc6, type: 3}
    text: "Let\u2019s see if these things still remember how to fight."
    vnText: "Xem xem\u2026 nh\u1EEFng h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng n\xE0y c\xF2n nh\u1EDB c\xE1ch
      chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u kh\xF4ng."
